# The patches must survive a checkout byte-for-byte: this repository has
# core.autocrlf=true, and git would otherwise rewrite their LF endings to CRLF on
# the next touch, which is enough to make `git apply` reject them.
*.patch -text

# The module sources are copied into a Godot tree, which is an LF tree (and the
# patch above is generated from those exact bytes).
module/nrr_dlss_bridge/* text eol=lf
